---
layout: layout.njk
title: What's new
description: "What changed in each update, newest first."
permalink: /whats-new/index.html
---
<section class="page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">Updates</p><h1>What's new</h1><p class="lede">One entry per update, newest first. Plain words for the people who run the shop.</p>
</section>
<section class="editorial section">
  <div class="prose">
    {% for u in updates %}
    <h3>{{ u.name }}</h3>
    <p>{{ u.intro }}</p>
    <ul>
      {% for item in u.items %}<li>{{ item }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endfor %}
    <h3>Earlier updates</h3>
    <p>Ten earlier updates, installed from September 25, laid the groundwork: the register, checks, the kitchen screen, printing, roles and reports.</p>
    <h3>By the numbers</h3>
    <p>Counted by script from the release list and the merged pull requests on {{ numbers.countedOn }}:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>{{ numbers.updates }}</strong> updates installed since {{ numbers.updatesSince }}</li>
      <li><strong>{{ numbers.features }}</strong> new features and <strong>{{ numbers.fixes }}</strong> fixes since {{ numbers.featuresSince }}</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
